. *--- 2. Pre-earthquake comparability (2000-2002) ---*
. di _n "=== 2. PRE-EARTHQUAKE COMPARABILITY (2000-2002) ==="

=== 2. PRE-EARTHQUAKE COMPARABILITY (2000-2002) ===

. 
. // Define pre-period
. gen byte pre_period = (year <= 2002)

. 
. // Age comparison
. di _n "--- Age ---"

--- Age ---

. tabstat age if pre_period, by(treat_quake) stat(mean sd n) format(%9.2f)

Summary for variables: age
Group variable: treat_quake (Molise resident)

treat_quake |      Mean        SD         N
------------+------------------------------
    Control |     36.92     12.47  49516.00
     Molise |     36.85     12.12  26486.00
------------+------------------------------
      Total |     36.90     12.35  76002.00
-------------------------------------------

. ttest age if pre_period, by(treat_quake)

Two-sample t test with equal variances
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Group |     Obs        Mean    Std. err.   Std. dev.   [95% conf. interval]
---------+--------------------------------------------------------------------
 Control |  49,516    36.92146     .056052     12.4728     36.8116    37.03132
  Molise |  26,486    36.85098    .0744901    12.12291    36.70497    36.99698
---------+--------------------------------------------------------------------
Combined |  76,002     36.8969    .0448047    12.35196    36.80908    36.98471
---------+--------------------------------------------------------------------
    diff |            .0704819    .0940305               -.1138174    .2547811
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    diff = mean(Control) - mean(Molise)                           t =   0.7496
H0: diff = 0                                     Degrees of freedom =    76000

    Ha: diff < 0                 Ha: diff != 0                 Ha: diff > 0
 Pr(T < t) = 0.7732         Pr(|T| > |t|) = 0.4535          Pr(T > t) = 0.2268

